# Expo Router

Role groups: `(auth)`, `(contact)`, `(agent)`, `(admin)`.

Shared thread: `app/chat/[id].tsx` → `/chat/:id`. Offers group id is literally `'offers'` → `/chat/offers`. Opening a thread is full-screen (no tab bar). That is intentional.

Chat and sign-in headers live on the **root** Stack only. Do not add a nested `chat/_layout` or auth Stack header — double navigators cause layout jump. Root `animation: 'slide_from_right'`. Sign out `router.replace('/(auth)/sign-in')`. Continue `router.replace(ROLE_HREF[DEV_ROLE])` — never bounce through `/`.

Contact tabs: **Home | Settings**. Inbox/Help are **hidden tab screens** (`href: null`) at `app/(contact)/messages.tsx` and `help.tsx` — tab bar stays. Do not nest `home/` under contact (Tabs without `index` hang Expo Router). Do not put messages/help on the root stack.

Agent tabs: **Chats | Unassigned | Settings**. Chats header title: **Messages**. Unassigned = `assigneeId === null` only; hide Open/Resolved chips.

Admin: slim tabs. Conversations = inbox over all threads (header **Messages**). Users / Overview stay shells until their phase.

Root `app/index.tsx` redirects from `DEV_ROLE` via `ROLE_HREF`. No auth gate until the auth phase.

Never gate `_layout` on `useFonts` / `SplashScreen.preventAutoHideAsync`. Hide splash once on mount; fonts load in the background.

Import navigation only from `expo-router`. Never `@react-navigation/*` (SDK 56+).

`id` param: `const id = Array.isArray(raw) ? raw[0] : raw`. Do not `Redirect` until params have hydrated.

Do not put test files under `app/`.
